    <Property Name="isEmpty" Id="{192e77ac-8afa-4522-a634-6d42cd0815a5}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary
This property indicates that a node or subunit is empty (no parts are physically present). It is used for the HMI connection.

